    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Hand of the Dynasty",
    "summary": "Ranged attacks made by your **IMMORTALS** and **NECRON WARRIORS** units have **[[ASSAULT]](vsdata:weapon-ability/assault)**. When one of those units is picked for an **[Advance move](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move)**, it can still **[start an action](vsdata:core-rule/performing-actions)** despite that move. This Detachment carries the **DYNASTY** tag, so it cannot be combined with another **DYNASTY** Detachment.",
